      "content": "I don't think there is anything left to heal. You talk about finding meaning, but how can there be meaning in a void? Every path I look at just leads back to this same emptiness. The struggle... it's just exhausting. I feel like I've reached the final page of the book, and there's nothing left but blank, white space. Is it even possible to find meaning when everything that mattered is already dead?",
